{
    "title": "Times Of India - News Updates",
    "description": "The Times of India news app provides a seamless news-reading experience with the latest updates from India and around the world. Stay informed on local, national and global news, political developments, live cricket scores and updates across business, technology, and entertainment. Available in 14 languages, including English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, and more, the TOI newspaper app ensures you never miss important stories and latest news.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n- News Briefs: Quick, concise updates for fast reading.\r\n- Morning & Evening Updates: Stay updated with daily notifications.\r\n- Live TV: Watch live coverage on Times Now, ET Now, and Zoom.\r\n- My News Feed: Customize your feed based on preferences.\r\n- Live Blog: Get real-time updates on sports, elections and more.\r\n- Interactive Games: Play crosswords, Sudoku, and more.\r\n\r\nWith the TOI+ subscription, enjoy unlimited access to exclusive, in-depth stories and expert opinions. Manage your subscription easily through the app.\r\n\r\nDownload the Times of India app today for breaking news, live news, election updates, market and business news, world news, and cricket news.\r\n\r\nFor more details, visit www.timesofindia.com.\r\nContact: toi.android@timesinternet.in\r\nPrivacy Policy: Privacy Policy\r\nTerms & Conditions: Terms & Conditions",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Times of India news app provides a seamless news-reading experience with the latest updates from India and around the world. Stay informed on local, national and global news, political developments, live cricket scores and updates across business, technology, and entertainment. Available in 14 languages, including English, Hindi, Telugu, Tamil, and more, the TOI newspaper app ensures you never miss important stories and latest news.<br><br>Key features include:<br>- News Briefs: Quick, concise updates for fast reading.<br>- Morning &amp; Evening Updates: Stay updated with daily notifications.<br>- Live TV: Watch live coverage on Times Now, ET Now, and Zoom.<br>- My News Feed: Customize your feed based on preferences.<br>- Live Blog: Get real-time updates on sports, elections and more.<br>- Interactive Games: Play crosswords, Sudoku, and more.<br><br>With the TOI+ subscription, enjoy unlimited access to exclusive, in-depth stories and expert opinions. Manage your subscription easily through the app.<br><br>Download the Times of India app today for breaking news, live news, election updates, market and business news, world news, and cricket news.<br><br>For more details, visit www.timesofindia.com.<br>Contact: toi.android@timesinternet.in<br>Privacy Policy: Privacy Policy<br>Terms &amp; Conditions: Terms &amp; Conditions",
